{"id":12,"course_id":6,"title":"Ultrasound Physics, Instrumentation and SPI Preparation","description":"Outcome: Students should understand the physical principles behind ultrasound image formation, recognise artefacts, optimise images and prepare for the Sonography Principles and Instrumentation (SPI) examination.\n\nThe SPI component should follow the current examination blueprint of the American Registry for Diagnostic Medical Sonography. SPI preparation alone does not establish eligibility for the examination or confer a professional credential.","position":1,"created_at":"2026-10-22T11:39:53.729264+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-22T11:39:53.729264+05:30"},
