{"id":22,"course_id":6,"title":"Ultrasound-Guided Interventions","description":"This should be a dedicated module because image-guided procedures require additional knowledge of anatomy, needle visualisation, asepsis, complications and procedural safety.\n\nImportant: This module should teach the principles, indications, preparation, imaging and safety considerations for interventions. Actual invasive procedures must be performed only by appropriately qualified and authorised practitioners under suitable supervision. A sonography education programme does not independently authorise a student to perform biopsies, drainage, injections or other invasive procedures.","position":11,"created_at":"2026-10-22T11:39:53.729264+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-22T11:39:53.729264+05:30"},
